{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DWt6wmUcXcP1bzPZ1K9Hgb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"createAISDKTelemetry \"agents/observability/ai\" Cloudflare agents\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AI Agent - Aug 6, 2026\",\"url\":\"https://flowith.io/blog/cloudflare-agent-tracing-opentelemetry-ai-sdk-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing: Cloudflare Agents\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/agents-on-cloudflare/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 08 04 agent tracing\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-08-04-agent-tracing/\"},{\"title\":\"Quick answer\",\"url\":\"https://flowith.io/blog/cloudflare-agents-observability-tracing-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"cloudflare agents\",\"url\":\"https://braintrust.dev/blog/cloudflare-agents\"},{\"title\":\"The Agent Development Lifecycle has arrived on Cloudflare\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/tag/tracing/\"},{\"title\":\"cloudflare agents\",\"url\":\"https://ai-proxy-gp5lhgcux.preview.braintrust.dev/blog/cloudflare-agents\"},{\"title\":\"Cloudflare Agents Gain Observability\",\"url\":\"https://www.startuphub.ai/news/cloudflare-agents-gain-observability\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/observability\"}]\n\nThe search didn't find anything for `createAISDKTelemetry`. The results instead point to `wrapAISDK` imported from `agents/observability/ai`, which may be the current name for that API.\n\n- **Primary source:** Cloudflare's changelog describes agent tracing for the Agents SDK. It shows the Wrangler setting that turns on Workers traces, and it says direct AI SDK calls need the AI SDK namespace wrapped once with `wrapAISDK()` from `agents/observability/ai` (wrap the AI SDK namespace once). It also notes that wrapAISDK() supports AI SDK v6 and v7.\n- **Launch coverage:** Cloudflare's launch post says agent tracing launches today with support for OpenTelemetry-compatible agent harnesses including Think, Flue, and AI SDK, and more.\n- **Third-party guides:** Two Flowith pages say AI SDK users should use Cloudflare's current wrapAISDK() adapter. Treat these as secondary, since they are less authoritative than Cloudflare's own changelog.\n- **Unverified:** I found no source confirming `createAISDKTelemetry`, so it may be an older or incorrect name. Check the Cloudflare Agents docs or the `agents` package exports before relying on it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a62a740-1c49-472a-9eea-d588a363a4f9","uuid":"5bed5876-6c14-47b6-b8c1-0fd9e7cc3aee","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:15:15.700Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"createAISDKTelemetry \"agents/observability/ai\" Cloudflare agents","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01P5Z8yb1c9uWpUeNnb3Vjjm","content":[{"title":"AI Agent - Aug 6, 2026","url":"https://flowith.io/blog/cloudflare-agent-tracing-opentelemetry-ai-sdk-guide/"},{"title":"Introducing: Cloudflare Agents","url":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/agents-on-cloudflare/"},{"title":"2026 08 04 agent tracing","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-08-04-agent-tracing/"},{"title":"Quick answer","url":"https://flowith.io/blog/cloudflare-agents-observability-tracing-guide/"},{"title":"cloudflare agents","url":"https://braintrust.dev/blog/cloudflare-agents"},{"title":"The Agent Development Lifecycle has arrived on Cloudflare","url":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/tag/tracing/"},{"title":"cloudflare agents","url":"https://ai-proxy-gp5lhgcux.preview.braintrust.dev/blog/cloudflare-agents"},{"title":"Cloudflare Agents Gain Observability","url":"https://www.startuphub.ai/news/cloudflare-agents-gain-observability"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/observability"}]},"The search didn't find anything for `createAISDKTelemetry`. The results instead point to `wrapAISDK` imported from `age